--- !u!114 &8820618927671616595
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 9172522820664080814}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6ee71bae2b2ea2d4386dce41c6feac80, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Dialoguebox
  DialogueSegments:
  - Dialogue: You two seem weary of something..?
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: eaff7ea8a8cfb0e45b2ee58dbe2e539a, type: 2}
    Choices: []
  - Dialogue: OH! Darling, a new guest!! We haven't had those in a while!
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 79f201457c6960c44b9b89cbb22cf8d4, type: 2}
    Choices: []
  - Dialogue: Yes, yes, our last guest was that strange man with the beast, but he
      never returned after... The incident...
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9fc13cbf5ef50f64c8b5ecd5934a1d60, type: 2}
    Choices: []
  - Dialogue: The... Incident?
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: eaff7ea8a8cfb0e45b2ee58dbe2e539a, type: 2}
    Choices: []
  - Dialogue: Ahaha, don't mind my silly husband. Always saying strange things.
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 79f201457c6960c44b9b89cbb22cf8d4, type: 2}
    Choices:
    - ChoiceText: "What about this \u201Cman with the beast?\u201D"
      NextSegmentIndex: 5
      Condition:
        Type: 0
        RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
        RequiredQuest: {fileID: 0}
      onChoiceSelected:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - ChoiceText: How do I get to the tower?
      NextSegmentIndex: 8
      Condition:
        Type: 0
        RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
        RequiredQuest: {fileID: 0}
      onChoiceSelected:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - ChoiceText: Goodbye.
      NextSegmentIndex: -1
      Condition:
        Type: 0
        RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
        RequiredQuest: {fileID: 0}
      onChoiceSelected:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
  - Dialogue: Some time ago, this wild man came along with a beast in tow. He rode
      into town on its back, demanding food and shelter!! And then, the incident...
      Our neighbor hasn't been the same since
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9fc13cbf5ef50f64c8b5ecd5934a1d60, type: 2}
    Choices: []
  - Dialogue: I've told you, Reg, our neighbor has always been like this! He's been
      plotting our downfall since the beginning! You stay clear of that hellspawn,
      young man! He's always sitting in that chair, staring us down. We just feel
      so unsafe! It's only a matter of time before he strikes!!
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 79f201457c6960c44b9b89cbb22cf8d4, type: 2}
    Choices: []
  - Dialogue: Now, calm down Martha... I'm sure we will be fine for another while...
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9fc13cbf5ef50f64c8b5ecd5934a1d60, type: 2}
    Choices:
    - ChoiceText: How do I get to the tower?
      NextSegmentIndex: 8
      Condition:
        Type: 0
        RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
        RequiredQuest: {fileID: 0}
      onChoiceSelected:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - ChoiceText: Goodbye.
      NextSegmentIndex: -1
      Condition:
        Type: 0
        RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
        RequiredQuest: {fileID: 0}
      onChoiceSelected:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
  - Dialogue: "Whatever it is, I\u2019m sure that kind smith will know! He's always
      been as sharp as the weapons he crafts!"
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 79f201457c6960c44b9b89cbb22cf8d4, type: 2}
    Choices: []
  - Dialogue: Wait, whatever it is? Haven't you seen that... Giant tower peeking
      over the mountains? The one me and many other travelers come here for?
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: eaff7ea8a8cfb0e45b2ee58dbe2e539a, type: 2}
    Choices: []
  - Dialogue: Ohh, that! Ahh, me and my darling husband just thought it was a very
      big tree.
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 79f201457c6960c44b9b89cbb22cf8d4, type: 2}
    Choices: []
  - Dialogue: I thought it was a shrub, personally...
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9fc13cbf5ef50f64c8b5ecd5934a1d60, type: 2}
    Choices:
    - ChoiceText: "What about this \u201Cman with the beast?\u201D"
      NextSegmentIndex: 5
      Condition:
        Type: 0
        RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
        RequiredQuest: {fileID: 0}
      onChoiceSelected:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - ChoiceText: Goodbye
      NextSegmentIndex: -1
      Condition:
        Type: 0
        RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
        RequiredQuest: {fileID: 0}
      onChoiceSelected:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
